      "writtenOn": "2026-09-17T11:44:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "from a high-level perspective I think it might be worthwhile separating this into capabilities and current info, but I think you just push it both down to the firmware or so?",
      "revId": "a03818347f8600b7c6a07b6ec7cf2f126b229bb0",
