        "id": 1003247
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-17T12:57:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, this just comes straight from the firmware.\n\nFor most of this stuff the driver is really just a middle man.\n\nSplitting it out would I think just pointlessly slow things down?\n(since it would require multiple rpcs into the fw)",
      "parentUuid": "cf08f2b9_362716e7",
      "revId": "a03818347f8600b7c6a07b6ec7cf2f126b229bb0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
